Document.description_en:
The community of Mashteuiatsh wishes to extend Amishk Street and undertake residential and institutional development. This project addresses the needs created by current population growth.

The project includes: the construction of institutional infrastructure such as a social pediatrics center, a senior living facility, a youth center, and a high school, as well as the development of 56 residential units.

The project&#39;s footprint for the institutional component is 13,582 square meters. The residential component covers 7,861 square meters.

The planned work includes:

- Clearing, stump removal, topsoil stripping, and reclamation of removed topsoil;

- Excavation and installation of drinking water, sanitary sewer, and stormwater systems;

- Relocation of the sanitary sewer outfall pipe;

- Construction of roadways, sidewalks, green islands, and paving.

The land is currently undeveloped. The site includes two wetlands in the short-term development zones, as well as larger wetlands in the future development zones. The work will be carried out in a manner that minimizes impacts on these wetlands and ensures the flow of water that feeds them.

Document.description_fr:
La communaut&eacute; de Mashteuiatsh souhaite prolonger la rue Amishk ainsi que proc&eacute;der &agrave; un d&eacute;veloppement de type r&eacute;sidentiel et institutionnel. Ce projet vient r&eacute;pondre aux besoins que la pression d&eacute;mographique actuelle a cr&eacute;&eacute;.&nbsp;

Le projet inclus: la construction d&#39;infrastructures institutionnelles tel qu&#39;un Centre de p&eacute;diatire sociale, une r&eacute;sidence pour a&icirc;n&eacute;s, une maison des jeunes et une &eacute;cole secondaire, ainsi que le d&eacute;veloppement de 56 unit&eacute;s r&eacute;sidentielles.&nbsp;

L&#39;empreinte du projet pour le volet institutionnel est de 13 582 m&egrave;tres carr&eacute;s. Le volet r&eacute;sidentiel repr&eacute;sente 7 861 m&egrave;tres carr&eacute;s.&nbsp;

Les travaux pr&eacute;vus sont:&nbsp;

- D&eacute;boisement, essouchement, d&eacute;capage et valorisation de la terre v&eacute;g&eacute;tale retir&eacute;e;

- Excavation et mise en place des r&eacute;seaux d&#39;eau potable, sanitaire et pluvial;

- D&eacute;placement de la conduite de refoulement des eaux sanitaires;

- Mise en place de la chauss&eacute;e, des trottoires, des &icirc;lots de verdures et du pavage.&nbsp;

Le terrain est actuellement non am&eacute;nag&eacute;. Le site comporte deux milieux humides dans les zones de d&eacute;veloppement &agrave; court terme ainsi que des milieux humides plus importants dans les zones de d&eacute;veloppements futurs. Les travaux seront effectu&eacute;s de sorte &agrave; limiter les impacts sur ces milieux et assurer l&#39;&eacute;coulement des eaux les alimentant.&nbsp;

