Document.description_en:
Eskay Creek Mining Limited is proposing the construction, operation and closure of an open-pit gold and silver mine located approximately 85&nbsp;kilometres northwest of Stewart, British Columbia. As proposed, the Eskay Creek Revitalization Project would produce up to 3.6&nbsp;million tonnes of ore per year (approximately 10,000&nbsp;tonnes per day) over 13&nbsp;years of operations. The 18-year mine life would include a two-year construction phase, 13-year operation phase, and three-year reclamation and closure phase. The project is located on the same site as the underground Eskay Creek mine, which is no longer operating, and the proponent will make use of some of its existing facilities and infrastructure.

&nbsp;

Please note that the proponent of this project was previously Skeena Resources Limited.

Document.description_fr:
Eskay Creek Mining Limited&nbsp;propose la construction, l&#39;exploitation et la fermeture d&#39;une mine d&#39;or et d&#39;argent &agrave; ciel ouvert, situ&eacute;e &agrave; environ 85&nbsp;kilom&egrave;tres au nord-ouest de Stewart, en Colombie-Britannique. Tel que propos&eacute;, le projet de revitalisation d&#39;Eskay Creek produirait jusqu&#39;&agrave; 3,6&nbsp;millions de tonnes de minerai par an (environ 10,000 tonnes par jour) sur une p&eacute;riode d&#39;exploitation de 13&nbsp;ans. La dur&eacute;e de vie totale de la mine serait-de 18 ans, incluant une phase de construction de deux ans, une phase d&#39;exploitation de 13&nbsp;ans et une phase de remise en &eacute;tat et de fermeture de trois ans. Le projet est situ&eacute; sur le m&ecirc;me site que la mine souterraine d&#39;Eskay Creek, qui n&#39;est plus en activit&eacute;, et le promoteur r&eacute;utilisera certaines de ses installations et infrastructures existantes.

&nbsp;

Veuillez noter que le promoteur de ce projet &eacute;tait pr&eacute;c&eacute;demment Skeena Resources Limited.

