Document.description_en:
The Proposed Project 

&nbsp;

Nibinamik First Nation is proposing various upgrades to the community nursing station&#39;s fuel system. Project activities will include:


	Decommissioning and removal of the old tank from the community;
	Construction of a concrete pad and placement of 50,000 L bulk fuel tank;
	Replacement of 3 existing day tanks;
	Removal and replacement of fuel system piping;
	Installation of two non-combustible fuel kiosks;
	Installation of a new control system; And
	Installation of fencing around the tank system.

Document.description_fr:
Projet propos&eacute;

&nbsp;

La Premi&egrave;re Nation de Nibinamik propose diverses am&eacute;liorations au syst&egrave;me d&#39;approvisionnement en carburant du poste de soins infirmiers communautaire. Les activit&eacute;s pr&eacute;vues comprennent&nbsp;:


	La mise hors service et le retrait de l&#39;ancien r&eacute;servoir;
	La construction d&#39;une dalle de b&eacute;ton et l&#39;installation d&#39;un r&eacute;servoir de carburant en vrac de 50&nbsp;000&nbsp;L&nbsp;;
	Le remplacement de trois r&eacute;servoirs journaliers existants;
	Le remplacement de la tuyauterie du syst&egrave;me d&#39;approvisionnement en carburant;
	L&#39;installation de deux kiosques &agrave; carburant incombustible;
	L&#39;installation d&#39;un nouveau syst&egrave;me de contr&ocirc;le; et
	L&#39;installation d&#39;une cl&ocirc;ture autour du syst&egrave;me de r&eacute;servoirs.

